    <div type="usagenotes">
        <!-- PREMIS Usage notes -->
        <p>When <italic>rightsBasis</italic> is “copyright”, repositories may need to extend this with more detailed information. See the California Digital Library's copyright schema (<ref target="http://www.cdlib.org/groups/rmg//">http://www.cdlib.org/groups/rmg//</ref>) for an example of a more detailed scheme.</p>
    </div>
